<script setup lang="ts">
/** 独立数学会话页：展示持久消息、生成流、授权来源与题图，并在断线后只恢复服务端保存事件。 */
import type { AgentAuthorizedReference, AgentConversation, AgentMessage } from "@edu/api-client";
import { SafeArticleContent } from "@edu/ui";
import { computed, nextTick, onBeforeUnmount, ref, watch } from "vue";
import { useRoute } from "vue-router";
import { studentAgentApi } from "../agent-api"; import { agentError } from "../agent-errors";
import { consumeAgentSse, emptyAgentStreamState, reduceAgentEvent } from "../agent-stream";
import type { AgentStreamState } from "../agent-stream"; import { uploadAiQuestionImage } from "../ai-image-upload";
import AiQuestionImage from "../components/AiQuestionImage.vue";
const route = useRoute(); const conversation = ref<AgentConversation | null>(null); const messages = ref<AgentMessage[]>([]);
const stream = ref<AgentStreamState | null>(null); const references = ref<AgentAuthorizedReference[]>([]); const content = ref(""); const imageIds = ref<string[]>([]);
const loading = ref(true); const sending = ref(false); const uploading = ref(false); const errorMessage = ref(""); const uploadMessage = ref("");
let controller: AbortController | null = null; let uploadController: AbortController | null = null;
const conversationId = computed(() => String(route.params.conversationId ?? ""));
const lastUserMessage = computed(() => [...messages.value].reverse().find(item => item.role === "USER" && item.contentState !== "PURGED"));
watch(conversationId, load, { immediate: true }); onBeforeUnmount(() => { controller?.abort(); uploadController?.abort(); if (stream.value?.runId && !stream.value.terminal) void studentAgentApi.cancel(stream.value.runId, "PAGE_CLOSED").catch(() => {}); });
async function load() { controller?.abort(); stream.value = null; messages.value = []; errorMessage.value = ""; loading.value = true; const active = new AbortController(); controller = active; try { const [item, history] = await Promise.all([studentAgentApi.conversation(conversationId.value, active.signal), loadAllMessages(active.signal)]); if (active.signal.aborted) return; conversation.value = item; messages.value = history; if (item.activeRunId) await recover(item.activeRunId); else await restoreLastReferences(history); } catch (error) { if (!active.signal.aborted) errorMessage.value = agentError(error); } finally { if (!active.signal.aborted) loading.value = false; } }
async function send() { const question = content.value.trim(); if (!question || sending.value || uploading.value) return; if (stream.value && !stream.value.terminal) await stop(); content.value = ""; const context = imageIds.value.length ? { aiQuestionMediaIds: [...imageIds.value] } : undefined; imageIds.value = []; await run(signal => studentAgentApi.send(conversationId.value, { clientRequestId: crypto.randomUUID(), content: question, context }, signal), question, context?.aiQuestionMediaIds ?? []); }
async function regenerate() { if (!lastUserMessage.value || sending.value) return; await run(signal => studentAgentApi.regenerate(conversationId.value, lastUserMessage.value!.id, crypto.randomUUID(), signal)); }
async function run(open: (signal: AbortSignal) => Promise<Response>, optimisticText?: string, mediaIds: string[] = []) { errorMessage.value = ""; sending.value = true; references.value = []; stream.value = emptyAgentStreamState(); if (optimisticText) messages.value.push({ id: crypto.randomUUID(), conversationId: conversationId.value, role: "USER", content: optimisticText, completeness: "COMPLETE", context: mediaIds.length ? { mediaIds } : undefined, sequenceNo: messages.value.length + 1, createdAt: new Date().toISOString() }); const active = new AbortController(); controller = active; try { const response = await open(active.signal); stream.value.runId = response.headers.get("X-Agent-Run-Id") ?? ""; await consumeAgentSse(response, event => { stream.value = reduceAgentEvent(stream.value!, event); references.value = stream.value.references; }, active.signal); if (!stream.value.terminal) throw new Error("AGENT_STREAM_TRUNCATED"); await refreshMessages(); } catch (error) { if (!active.signal.aborted) { errorMessage.value = agentError(error, "连接中断，正在读取已保存事件…"); const runId = responseRunId(stream.value); if (runId) await recover(runId); } } finally { sending.value = false; } }
async function recover(runId: string) { try { const page = await studentAgentApi.events(runId); let state = emptyAgentStreamState(); for (const event of page.items) state = reduceAgentEvent(state, event); stream.value = state; references.value = state.references; if (state.terminal) await refreshMessages(); else errorMessage.value = "连接已中断；这里只显示服务端已保存的部分回答，可稍后刷新继续恢复。"; } catch (error) { errorMessage.value = agentError(error, "已保存事件暂时无法恢复。"); } }
async function stop() { const current = stream.value; controller?.abort(); if (!current?.runId) { sending.value = false; return; } try { await studentAgentApi.cancel(current.runId, "USER_STOP"); await recover(current.runId); } catch (error) { errorMessage.value = agentError(error, "停止请求未确认，请刷新查看最终状态。"); } finally { sending.value = false; } }
async function loadAllMessages(signal?: AbortSignal) { const first = await studentAgentApi.messages(conversationId.value, 1, 100, signal); const all = [...first.items]; for (let page = 2; all.length < first.total; page += 1) { const next = await studentAgentApi.messages(conversationId.value, page, 100, signal); all.push(...next.items); if (!next.items.length) break; } return all; }
async function refreshMessages() { messages.value = await loadAllMessages(); await nextTick(); }
async function restoreLastReferences(history: AgentMessage[]) { const runId = [...history].reverse().find(item => item.role === "ASSISTANT" && item.runId)?.runId; if (!runId) return; const page = await studentAgentApi.events(runId); references.value = page.items.flatMap(event => event.eventType === "REFERENCE" ? [event.payload.reference] : event.eventType === "FINAL_RESULT" ? event.payload.references ?? [] : []).filter((item, index, all) => all.findIndex(candidate => candidate.referenceId === item.referenceId) === index); }
async function chooseImage(event: Event) { const input = event.target as HTMLInputElement; const file = input.files?.[0]; input.value = ""; if (!file) return; uploadController?.abort(); const active = new AbortController(); uploadController = active; uploading.value = true; uploadMessage.value = ""; try { const id = await uploadAiQuestionImage(file, active.signal, message => uploadMessage.value = message); imageIds.value.push(id); uploadMessage.value = "题图已就绪，只会随消息发送稳定 mediaId。"; } catch (error) { if (!active.signal.aborted) uploadMessage.value = agentError(error, "题图上传失败。"); } finally { uploading.value = false; } }
function responseRunId(state: AgentStreamState | null) { return state?.runId || conversation.value?.activeRunId || ""; }
function sourceLabel(source: AgentAuthorizedReference["sourceType"]) { return ({ QUESTION: "题目", KNOWLEDGE_POINT: "知识点", COURSE_TEXT: "课程正文", STUDENT_FACT: "本人学习事实", USER_HELP: "平台帮助" } as const)[source]; }
</script>
<template><main class="ai-chat" aria-labelledby="chat-title"><header class="ai-chat__header"><div><RouterLink to="/ai">← 返回会话</RouterLink><h1 id="chat-title">{{ conversation?.title || "AI 数学答疑" }}</h1></div><button v-if="sending" class="button button--danger" type="button" @click="stop">停止生成</button></header>
  <p v-if="errorMessage" class="feedback feedback--error" role="alert">{{ errorMessage }}</p><div v-if="loading" class="ai-empty" role="status">正在恢复会话…</div>
  <section v-else class="ai-message-list" aria-live="polite"><article v-for="message in messages" :key="message.id" class="ai-message" :class="`ai-message--${message.role.toLowerCase()}`"><header><strong>{{ message.role === "USER" ? "你" : "AI 助教" }}</strong><span>{{ new Date(message.createdAt).toLocaleTimeString() }}</span></header><p v-if="message.contentState === 'PURGED'" class="ai-purged">原始内容已按保留策略清理。</p><SafeArticleContent v-else :source="message.content" :images="[]"/><div v-if="message.role === 'USER' && message.context?.mediaIds?.length" class="ai-message-images"><AiQuestionImage v-for="id in message.context.mediaIds" :key="id" :media-id="id" /></div><small v-if="message.completeness === 'PARTIAL'" class="ai-partial">回答已中断</small></article>
    <article v-if="stream && (sending || !stream.terminal)" class="ai-message ai-message--assistant"><header><strong>AI 助教</strong><span>{{ stream.stage || "正在思考" }}</span></header><SafeArticleContent :source="stream.answer" :images="[]"/><small v-if="stream.partial">回答已中断</small></article></section>
  <section v-if="references.length" class="ai-references" aria-labelledby="reference-title"><h2 id="reference-title">授权来源</h2><ul><li v-for="item in references" :key="item.referenceId"><span>{{ sourceLabel(item.sourceType) }}</span><RouterLink v-if="item.appRoute" :to="item.appRoute">{{ item.title }}</RouterLink><strong v-else>{{ item.title }}</strong></li></ul></section>
  <button v-if="lastUserMessage && !sending" class="button button--quiet ai-regenerate" type="button" @click="regenerate">重新生成最后一问（计入新运行）</button>
  <form class="ai-composer" @submit.prevent="send"><label for="ai-question" class="sr-only">输入数学问题</label><textarea id="ai-question" v-model="content" rows="4" maxlength="8000" placeholder="输入问题；支持 Markdown 与 LaTeX 公式" :disabled="sending"></textarea><div class="ai-composer__actions"><label class="button button--quiet"><input class="sr-only" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" :disabled="sending || uploading" @change="chooseImage">{{ uploading ? "正在上传…" : "添加题图" }}</label><span v-if="imageIds.length">已附加 {{ imageIds.length }} 张题图</span><button class="button button--primary" type="submit" :disabled="sending || uploading || !content.trim()">发送</button></div><p v-if="uploadMessage" role="status">{{ uploadMessage }}</p></form></main></template>
